    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p7-q17-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Find the remainder when $2222^{2222}$ is divided by 5.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$4$",
          "worked": "Since $2222\\equiv2\\pmod5$, $2^4\\equiv1\\pmod5$, and $2222=4\\times555+2$,\n$$\\begin{align*}2222^{2222}&\\equiv2^{2222}\\pmod5\\\\2222^{2222}&\\equiv(2^4)^{555}\\times2^2\\pmod5\\\\2222^{2222}&\\equiv1^{555}\\times4\\pmod5\\\\2222^{2222}&\\equiv4\\pmod5.\\end{align*}$$\nThe remainder is $4$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 42
      },
      {
        "id": "p7-q17-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "Hence, find the remainder when $(2222^{2222})^{2222}$ is divided by 5.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$1$",
          "worked": "From part (a), $2222^{2222}\\equiv4\\equiv-1\\pmod5$. Since $2222$ is even,\n$$\\begin{align*}(2222^{2222})^{2222}&\\equiv4^{2222}\\pmod5\\\\(2222^{2222})^{2222}&\\equiv(-1)^{2222}\\pmod5\\\\(2222^{2222})^{2222}&\\equiv1\\pmod5.\\end{align*}$$\nThe remainder is $1$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 36
      }
    ]
  },
